                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Add products or services with description, quantity, rate, and tax – as many as you need.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">💰 Tax Ready</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Support for GST, VAT, HST, sales tax, or custom rates – per line item.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">📄 Instant PDF Download</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            One click generates a high-quality PDF – ready to email or print.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">🔒 No Signup Required</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            No account, no email, no data storage – your privacy is protected.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">📱 Mobile Friendly</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Create invoices from your phone, tablet, or laptop – anywhere.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Designed for the Way You Work</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    You didn't start your small business to spend hours on paperwork. RatPDF gives you a simple, free tool to create professional invoices that get you paid faster. Whether you sell products, services, subscriptions, or creative work – our invoice generator works for you.
                </p>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    No subscriptions, no hidden fees, no watermarks. Just clean, professional PDF invoices that you can send to clients immediately.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ 100% free – unlimited use</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ No software to install</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Works for any small business type</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Instant PDF download</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Trusted by 1M+ businesses</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
                <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-4 p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">Ready to Simplify Your Small Business Billing?</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4">
                        Create your first professional invoice in under a minute – free and no signup.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-semibold">
                        Create Small Business Invoice Now
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        How do I create an invoice for my small business?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Enter your business name and details, add client information, then list your products or services with quantity and rate. Add tax if needed, set payment terms, and click "Generate PDF". Your professional invoice is ready to download.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Is this really free for small businesses?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes, completely free. No credit card, no subscription, no watermark. Create unlimited invoices.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Can I add my company logo to the invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes, you can provide a URL to your logo image, and it will be displayed on the invoice.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        What tax rates are supported?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        You can set any tax rate per line item – 0%, 5%, 9%, 10%, 15%, 18%, 20%, or custom. Supports GST, VAT, HST, sales tax, and more.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Do I need an account to use this tool?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account needed. Just open the page, create your invoice, and download – we don't store any data.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Create Professional Small Business Invoices in Seconds</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
            Join thousands of small business owners who use RatPDF to bill with confidence.
        </p>
        <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-5 py-3">
            Start Creating Small Business Invoices
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

